(All latitudes and longitudes referred to in this schedule are determined according to the NAD 27 datum. All parallels of latitude referred to in this schedule are to be determined in such a manner that they are parallel with boundaries of grid areas as defined by the Canada Oil and Gas Land Regulations.)
COMMENCING at the intersection of latitude 42 degrees 30' 00"N and the geodetic line from point C to point D of the Single Maritime Boundary between Canada and the United States of America, at approximate longitude 67 degrees 27' 05"W, said Boundary constituted by the Judgement of the Chamber of the International Court of Justice at The Hague on October 12, 1984, said point C being at latitude 42 degrees 31' 08"N and longitude 67 degrees 28' 05"W and said point D being at latitude 40 degrees 27' 05"N and longitude 65 degrees 41' 59"W as shown in said Judgement;
THENCE easterly along latitude 42 degrees 30'00"to longitude 66 degrees 30'00"W;
THENCE south along longitude 66 degrees 30'00"W to latitude 42 degrees 25'00"N;
THENCE easterly along latitude 42 degrees 25'00"N to longitude 65 degrees 45'00"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 45'00"W to latitude 42 degrees 20'00"N;
THENCE easterly along latitude 42 degrees 20'00"N to longitude 65 degrees 37'30"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 37'30"W to latitude 42 degrees lOW'N;
THENCE easterly along latitude 42 degrees I0'00"N to longitude 65 degrees 30'00"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 30' 00"W to latitude 42 degrees 05' 00"N;
THENCE easterly along latitude 42 degrees 05' 00"N to longitude 65 degrees 22' 30"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 22' 30"W to latitude 41 degrees 50' 00"N;
THENCE westerly along latitude 41 degrees 50' 00"N to longitude 65 degrees 30' 00"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 30' 00"W to latitude 41 degrees 40' 00"N;
THENCE westerly along latitude 41 degrees 40' 00"N to longitude 65 degrees 37' 30"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 37' 30"W to latitude 41 degrees 35' 00"N;
THENCE westerly along latitude 41 degrees 35' 00"N to longitude 65 degrees 45' 00"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 45'00"W to latitude 41 degrees 25'00"N;
THENCE westerly along latitude 41 degrees 25'00"N to longitude 65 degrees 52'30"W;
THENCE south along longitude 65 degrees 52'30"W to latitude 41 degrees 15'00"N;
THENCE westerly along latitude 41 degrees 15'00"N to longitude 66 degrees 07'30"W;
THENCE south along longitude 66 degrees 07'30"W to latitude 41 degrees 05'00"N;
THENCE westerly along latitude 41 degrees 05'00"N to its intersection with said geodetic line from point C to point D, at approximate longitude 66 degrees 13'33"W;
THENCE northwesterly along said geodetic line to the point of commencement."
